{"title":"Career Roadmap · Infographic Designer","role":"Infographic Designer","summary":"An Infographic Designer transforms complex information, data, statistics, research, and concepts into clear, visually engaging, and easy-to-understand graphics. The role combines graphic design, information architecture, data literacy, storytelling, typography, visual hierarchy, and increasingly AI-assisted data workflows.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)","Course":"Data Visualisation / Information Design"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Infographic Designer transforms complex information, data, statistics, research, and concepts into clear, visually engaging, and easy-to-understand graphics. The role combines graphic design, information architecture, data literacy, storytelling, typography, visual hierarchy, and increasingly AI-assisted data workflows."},{"type":"p","text":"A strong infographic designer is not simply someone who makes attractive charts. They understand what information matters, how it should be structured, and how visual choices affect comprehension."}]},{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Area","Details"],"rows":[[{"text":"Degree"},{"text":"B.Des – Data Visualisation / Information Design"}],[{"text":"Primary Career"},{"text":"Infographic Designer"}],[{"text":"Core Work"},{"text":"Visualising complex information"}],[{"text":"Major Outputs"},{"text":"Infographics, dashboards, reports, data stories, diagrams"}],[{"text":"Design Skills"},{"text":"Typography, layout, colour, composition, visual hierarchy"}],[{"text":"Data Skills"},{"text":"Statistics, spreadsheets, data cleaning, chart selection"}],[{"text":"Tools"},{"text":"Illustrator, Figma, Photoshop, InDesign"}],[{"text":"Data Tools"},{"text":"Excel, Power BI, Tableau"}],[{"text":"Coding Advantage"},{"text":"Python, JavaScript, D3.js"}],[{"text":"Key Differentiator"},{"text":"Accuracy + clarity + visual storytelling"}]]}]},{"heading":"What Does an Infographic Designer Do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An infographic designer can convert something like:"},{"type":"h","text":"50-page research report → one clear visual story"},{"type":"h","text":"Typical outputs include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Statistical infographics"},{"text":"Business reports"},{"text":"Annual reports"},{"text":"Research visualisations"},{"text":"Educational graphics"},{"text":"Process diagrams"},{"text":"Timelines"},{"text":"Maps"},{"text":"Comparison charts"},{"text":"Explainer graphics"},{"text":"Data-driven social media graphics"},{"text":"Interactive dashboards"},{"text":"Editorial infographics"},{"text":"Policy visualisations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"The fundamental workflow is:"},{"type":"h","text":"Raw Information"},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Understanding"},{"type":"h","text":"Information Architecture"},{"type":"h","text":"Visual Hierarchy"},{"type":"h","text":"Chart / Diagram Selection"},{"type":"h","text":"Design"},{"type":"h","text":"Validation"},{"type":"h","text":"Final Infographic"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Experience","Possible Role"],"rows":[[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Junior Infographic Designer"}],[{"text":"1–3 years"},{"text":"Information Designer"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"Data Visualization Designer"}],[{"text":"3–6 years"},{"text":"Visual Communication Designer"}],[{"text":"4–8 years"},{"text":"Senior Information Designer"}],[{"text":"5–10 years"},{"text":"Data Visualization Lead"}],[{"text":"7–12 years"},{"text":"Information Design Director"}],[{"text":"8–15 years"},{"text":"Data Storytelling Consultant"}],[{"text":"Long-term"},{"text":"Independent Information Design Studio"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Related career paths include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data Visualization Designer"},{"text":"Information Designer"},{"text":"Visual Data Storyteller"},{"text":"Editorial Infographic Designer"},{"text":"Dashboard Designer"},{"text":"UX Information Designer"},{"text":"Visual Communication Designer"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 1 — Visual Communication Foundations","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build strong graphic-design fundamentals."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Typography"},{"text":"Layout"},{"text":"Composition"},{"text":"Colour theory"},{"text":"Grid systems"},{"text":"Visual hierarchy"},{"text":"Iconography"},{"text":"Basic illustration"},{"text":"Information hierarchy"},{"text":"Visual storytelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Projects"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Timeline infographic"},{"text":"Process diagram"},{"text":"Educational poster"},{"text":"Statistical poster"},{"text":"Visual comparison chart"},{"text":"Information map"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Goal"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to communicate one clear message visually."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Data + Information Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Move beyond graphic design into information structuring."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Data types"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Data interpretation"},{"text":"Chart selection"},{"text":"Data hierarchy"},{"text":"Information architecture"},{"text":"Visual encoding"},{"text":"Comparative analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Understand"},{"type":"h","text":"When to use:"},{"type":"table","header":["Data Type","Suitable Visual"],"rows":[[{"text":"Comparison"},{"text":"Bar chart"}],[{"text":"Trend"},{"text":"Line chart"}],[{"text":"Composition"},{"text":"Stacked bar / appropriate part-to-whole chart"}],[{"text":"Distribution"},{"text":"Histogram"}],[{"text":"Relationship"},{"text":"Scatter plot"}],[{"text":"Geography"},{"text":"Map"}],[{"text":"Process"},{"text":"Flow diagram"}],[{"text":"Timeline"}],[{"text":"Hierarchy"},{"text":"Tree / nested structure"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"The designer should choose the visual form based on the information, rather than choosing a chart simply because it looks attractive."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Advanced Data Storytelling"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop the ability to transform datasets into narratives."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data storytelling"},{"text":"Dashboard design"},{"text":"Interactive visualisation"},{"text":"Data journalism"},{"text":"Editorial design"},{"text":"Research communication"},{"text":"Information architecture"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Responsive visualisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tools"},{"type":"h","text":"Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Figma"},{"text":"Illustrator"},{"text":"Photoshop"},{"text":"InDesign"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Google Sheets"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Tableau"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"matplotlib"},{"text":"Plotly"},{"text":"JavaScript"},{"text":"D3.js"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A student does not need to master everything. A strong combination could be:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Figma","Illustrator","Excel","Power BI","Python"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Professional Information Design"},{"type":"p","text":"The final year should focus on complex, real-world information."},{"type":"h","text":"Capstone project examples"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Public Health"},{"type":"h","text":"Create an infographic explaining:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"How air pollution affects urban health.\""},{"type":"h","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data"},{"text":"Trends"},{"text":"Geographic information"},{"text":"Health effects"},{"text":"Recommendations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Economic Data"},{"type":"h","text":"Create:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"India's changing employment landscape.\""},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Sustainability"},{"type":"h","text":"Create:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"The lifecycle of plastic.\""},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Convert a lengthy research paper into:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Executive infographic"},{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"Research poster"},{"text":"Interactive dashboard"}]}]},{"heading":"Specialisations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"A. Data Visualization Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Dashboards"},{"text":"Analytics"},{"text":"Data storytelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Consulting"},{"text":"Business intelligence"}]},{"type":"h","text":"B. Editorial Infographic Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Works with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Newspapers"},{"text":"Magazines"},{"text":"Digital publications"},{"text":"Newsrooms"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Current affairs"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Explanatory graphics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"C. Scientific Visualization Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Visualises:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Scientific research"},{"text":"Healthcare information"},{"text":"Climate data"},{"text":"Medical information"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Requires stronger scientific/data literacy."},{"type":"h","text":"D. Business Information Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Creates:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Annual reports"},{"text":"Investor presentations"},{"text":"Business dashboards"},{"text":"Market reports"},{"text":"Strategy visualisations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"E. UX Information Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Focuses on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Information architecture"},{"text":"Interfaces"},{"text":"Complex data"},{"text":"User comprehension"}]},{"type":"h","text":"F. Interactive Data Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Design","Data","Web Technology"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Tools can include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"JavaScript"},{"text":"D3.js"},{"text":"React"},{"text":"WebGL"},{"text":"Interactive mapping"}]}]},{"heading":"Essential Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Typography"},{"text":"Grid systems"},{"text":"Layout"},{"text":"Colour"},{"text":"Iconography"},{"text":"Illustration"},{"text":"Visual hierarchy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Information"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Information architecture"},{"text":"Data interpretation"},{"text":"Storytelling"},{"text":"Diagramming"},{"text":"Chart design"},{"text":"Research synthesis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Basic SQL"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Visualization"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Tableau"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Plotly"},{"text":"D3.js"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Brief interpretation"},{"text":"Client communication"},{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Fact-checking"},{"text":"Version control"},{"text":"Accessibility"}]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Start internships from Year 2."},{"type":"h","text":"Target organisations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design studios"},{"text":"Data visualization agencies"},{"text":"Consulting firms"},{"text":"Media organisations"},{"text":"Newsrooms"},{"text":"Research institutions"},{"text":"Think tanks"},{"text":"Technology companies"},{"text":"Financial organisations"},{"text":"NGOs"},{"text":"Marketing agencies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Infographic Design Intern"},{"text":"Information Design Intern"},{"text":"Data Visualization Intern"},{"text":"Visual Communication Intern"},{"text":"UX Design Intern"},{"text":"Data Storytelling Intern"},{"text":"Research Visualization Intern"}]}]},{"heading":"Portfolio Strategy","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A good portfolio should prove three things:"},{"type":"p","text":"You understand the data."},{"type":"p","text":"You understand the audience."},{"type":"p","text":"You can communicate the insight clearly."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended case-study structure"},{"type":"h","text":"Problem"},{"type":"h","text":"Audience"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Sources"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Cleaning"},{"type":"h","text":"Key Insight"},{"type":"h","text":"Information Architecture"},{"type":"h","text":"Sketches"},{"type":"h","text":"Chart Selection"},{"type":"h","text":"Visual System"},{"type":"h","text":"Final Infographic"},{"type":"h","text":"Validation"}]},{"heading":"Recommended Portfolio Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Data Story"},{"type":"h","text":"India's population growth"},{"type":"h","text":"Demonstrate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Timeline"},{"text":"Geographic comparison"},{"text":"Trends"},{"text":"Visual hierarchy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Business Dashboard"},{"type":"h","text":"Create a dashboard covering:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Growth"},{"text":"Customers"},{"text":"Products"},{"text":"Regions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Scientific Infographic"},{"type":"p","text":"Explain a scientific concept visually."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Social Issue"},{"type":"h","text":"Example:"},{"type":"h","text":"Urban water consumption"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Interactive Visualization"},{"type":"h","text":"Build a web-based data story using:"},{"type":"flow","items":["HTML","CSS","JavaScript","D3.js"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Data Accuracy & Ethics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the most important skills for an Infographic Designer."},{"type":"h","text":"Avoid:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Distorted axes"},{"text":"Misleading scales"},{"text":"Cherry-picked data"},{"text":"Unclear sources"},{"text":"Unnecessary 3D charts"},{"text":"Decorative visualisations that distort meaning"},{"text":"Ambiguous percentages"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Always consider:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Source"},{"text":"Date"},{"text":"Sample size"},{"text":"Units"},{"text":"Methodology"},{"text":"Uncertainty"},{"text":"Context"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A beautiful infographic with incorrect or misleading information is a bad information design product."}]},{"heading":"Accessibility","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Professional information designers should understand accessibility."},{"type":"h","text":"Consider:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Colour contrast"},{"text":"Colour-blind-friendly palettes"},{"text":"Typography size"},{"text":"Alternative text"},{"text":"Clear labels"},{"text":"Simple language"},{"text":"Keyboard accessibility for interactive graphics"},{"text":"Responsive layouts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"The objective is:"},{"type":"p","text":"More people should be able to understand the information."}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Useful areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data Visualization"},{"text":"Information Design"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Tableau"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"UX Research"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Python for Data Analysis"},{"text":"D3.js"},{"text":"Graphic Design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"But the priority should be:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Real projects","portfolio","data literacy","software skills","certificates"]}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Roles","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"After graduation, target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Junior Infographic Designer"},{"text":"Information Designer"},{"text":"Data Visualization Designer"},{"text":"Visual Communication Designer"},{"text":"Data Storytelling Designer"},{"text":"Editorial Designer"},{"text":"Dashboard Designer"},{"text":"UX Information Designer"},{"text":"Research Visualization Designer"},{"text":"Visual Data Analyst"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Some employers may use different titles for essentially similar responsibilities."}]},{"heading":"Interview Preparation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What makes a good infographic?"},{"text":"How do you establish visual hierarchy?"},{"text":"How do you choose colours?"},{"text":"How do you simplify complex information?"},{"text":"How do you design for different audiences?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What is the difference between correlation and causation?"},{"text":"How do you clean data?"},{"text":"How do you select the right chart?"},{"text":"What makes a chart misleading?"},{"text":"How would you visualise a large dataset?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Explain one portfolio project."},{"text":"What was the original dataset?"},{"text":"What was your biggest design decision?"},{"text":"What insight did you discover?"},{"text":"How did you validate the final visual?"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Possible pathways include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Des Information Design"},{"text":"M.Des Data Visualization"},{"text":"M.Des Communication Design"},{"text":"M.Des Interaction Design"},{"text":"M.Des UX Design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology/Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data Science"},{"text":"Business Analytics"},{"text":"Data Visualization"},{"text":"Human-Computer Interaction"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Communication"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Visual Communication"},{"text":"Information Communication"},{"text":"Digital Media"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A master's is not mandatory if the student develops strong data + design + portfolio capabilities."}]},{"heading":"Specialist Career Routes","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Data Visualization"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Des"},{"type":"h","text":"Junior Infographic Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Visualization Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Data Visualization Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Visualization Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Visualization Director"},{"type":"h","text":"Interactive Visualization"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Des"},{"type":"h","text":"Information Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Visualization Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Interactive Data Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Interactive Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Creative Technology / Visualization Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"UX Information Design"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Des"},{"type":"h","text":"Information Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"UX / Information Architect"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior UX Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Design Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Design Director"}]},{"heading":"Entrepreneurship Path","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An experienced designer can establish a specialised data storytelling studio."},{"type":"h","text":"Services"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Infographics"},{"text":"Annual reports"},{"text":"Research visualisation"},{"text":"Data dashboards"},{"text":"Investor reports"},{"text":"Interactive data stories"},{"text":"Presentation design"},{"text":"Scientific communication"},{"text":"Policy visualisation"},{"text":"Corporate communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Potential clients include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Companies"},{"text":"Research institutions"},{"text":"Universities"},{"text":"NGOs"},{"text":"Governments"},{"text":"Consulting firms"},{"text":"Media organisations"},{"text":"Financial institutions"}]}]},{"heading":"AI + Infographic Design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI will significantly accelerate information-design workflows."},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging applications"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Automated data summaries"},{"text":"AI-assisted chart recommendations"},{"text":"Data cleaning assistance"},{"text":"Natural-language querying"},{"text":"Automated dashboard generation"},{"text":"AI-generated visual concepts"},{"text":"Narrative generation"},{"text":"Interactive conversational visualisation"},{"text":"Automated report-to-infographic workflows"}]},{"type":"h","text":"A future workflow could be:"},{"type":"h","text":"Dataset"},{"type":"h","text":"AI-Assisted Exploration"},{"type":"h","text":"Important Insights"},{"type":"h","text":"Designer Validation"},{"type":"h","text":"Information Architecture"},{"type":"h","text":"Visual Design"},{"type":"h","text":"Human Review"},{"type":"h","text":"Final Data Story"},{"type":"p","text":"The designer still needs to verify accuracy, context, bias, source quality and visual integrity."}]},{"heading":"2040–2046 Career Evolution","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Future Role","Combination"],"rows":[[{"text":"AI Data Storyteller"},{"text":"Data + AI + Narrative"}],[{"text":"Interactive Information Designer"},{"text":"Data + UX + Web"}],[{"text":"Scientific Visualization Specialist"},{"text":"Science + Data + Design"}],[{"text":"AI Dashboard Designer"},{"text":"BI + AI + UX"}],[{"text":"Immersive Data Designer"},{"text":"Data + AR/VR"}],[{"text":"Real-Time Visualization Designer"},{"text":"Data Streams + Design"}],[{"text":"Data Experience Designer"},{"text":"UX + Analytics"}],[{"text":"Information Design Strategist"},{"text":"Research + Design Strategy"}],[{"text":"Computational Visualization Designer"},{"text":"Coding + Visualisation"}],[{"text":"AI Information Architect"},{"text":"AI + Information Systems"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"The profession will increasingly move from static infographic production toward interactive, real-time and intelligent information experiences."}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"By graduation, the ideal profile is:"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Des – Data Visualisation / Information Design"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Graphic Design"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Typography"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Information Architecture"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Literacy"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Statistics Fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI / Tableau"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Figma"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Illustrator"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Python / pandas"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Interactive Visualization"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"D3.js Basics"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Storytelling"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Accessibility"},{"type":"h","text":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"AI-Assisted Data Workflow"}]},{"heading":"Target Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1"},{"type":"h","text":"Visual Communication Designer"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn typography, layout, colour and visual hierarchy."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2"},{"type":"h","text":"Information Designer"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn data, diagrams, information architecture and chart design."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Visualization Designer"},{"type":"p","text":"Work with dashboards, interactive graphics and data storytelling."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional Infographic Designer"},{"type":"p","text":"Create complex, evidence-based visual communication projects."},{"type":"h","text":"0–3 Years After Graduation"},{"type":"h","text":"Junior → Information/Data Visualization Designer"},{"type":"p","text":"Build industry experience and specialise."},{"type":"h","text":"4–8 Years"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Visualization Designer / Data Storytelling Lead"},{"type":"p","text":"Handle complex projects and mentor designers."},{"type":"h","text":"8–15 Years"},{"type":"h","text":"Visualization Director / Information Design Strategist"},{"type":"p","text":"Lead teams, visual systems and large-scale information products."},{"type":"h","text":"Long-Term"},{"type":"h","text":"Data Storytelling Consultant / Visualization Studio Founder / Information Design Director"}]},{"heading":"Best Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A highly competitive graduate should ideally have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"📊 Strong data-visualisation fundamentals"},{"text":"🎨 Excellent graphic-design skills"},{"text":"🔤 Strong typography and layout"},{"text":"🧠 Information-architecture capability"},{"text":"📈 Understanding of statistics and chart selection"},{"text":"🧹 Basic data-cleaning skills"},{"text":"💻 Excel + Power BI/Tableau"},{"text":"🎨 Figma + Illustrator"},{"text":"🐍 Python/pandas fundamentals"},{"text":"🌐 Basic D3.js or interactive visualization"},{"text":"🔎 Strong research and fact-checking habits"},{"text":"♿ Accessibility awareness"},{"text":"🤖 AI-assisted data-analysis capability"},{"text":"📁 5–7 strong portfolio case studies"},{"text":"💼 At least one relevant internship"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Best career strategy","text":"Graduate not simply as a graphic designer who creates charts, but as an information designer who can take raw data or complex research, identify the important insight, structure the information, choose an appropriate visual language, design an accurate and accessible visual story, and communicate it effectively across print, digital, dashboard and interactive formats."}]}]}